<title>ESTONIA: HOIU OFFERS SHARE DEALS THROUGH INTERNET.</title>
<headline>HOIU OFFERS SHARE DEALS THROUGH INTERNET.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Hoiupank said on Tuesday that its customers will be able to use its Internet home-page to buy and sell shares listed on the Tallinn stock exchange from April 23.</p>
<p>Hoiupank's Panganet, launched last year, allows customers to make banking transactions via the Internet.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
